{"id": "629-post-veteran-housing-bridge-loan", "title": "At 629 Post, a two-year housing bridge loan runs into a fourth year", "seconds": 58.5, "voice": "elevenlabs:OtHu0lbpdNTqJVqaxDtR", "narrator": "Maven", "made": "2026-11-25", "key": "746992a8fb631f40", "words": 183, "beats": [{"scene": "open", "kind": "hook", "ref": ["amount", "established[0]"], "text": "In June 2023, the City financed veterans housing at 629 Post Street.", "t0": 0.2, "t1": 4.97, "shot": "r0", "visual": {"type": "hook", "words": ["A", "housing", "bridge", "loan"], "sub": "629 Post Street"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.16, 0.4, 0.65, 1.38, 1.55, 1.85, 2.33, 2.79, 3.2, 3.36, 3.71, 4.23, 4.49]}, {"scene": "open", "kind": "bignum", "ref": ["amount", "established[0]"], "text": "The loan carried zero interest. Its face amount was 30,385,225 dollars.", "t0": 5.09, "t1": 9.64, "shot": "r1", "visual": {"type": "bignum", "value": "$30,385,225", "label": "acquisition and rehabilitation loan"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.13, 0.41, 0.69, 0.99, 1.82, 2.04, 2.28, 2.56, 2.7, 2.94, 3.27, 3.54, 3.76, 4.05]}, {"scene": "open", "kind": "quote", "ref": ["notEstablished[0]"], "text": "The delay raises a lead, not a finding.", "t0": 9.76, "t1": 11.51, "shot": "r2", "visual": {"type": "quote", "line": "A lead"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.12, 0.41, 0.72, 0.8, 1.1, 1.25, 1.31]}, {"scene": "open", "kind": "record", "ref": ["suspicious[0]", "established[1]", "timeline[0]", "timeline[1]", "timeline[4]"], "text": "The City doubled the bridge term from 24 to 48 months.", "t0": 11.63, "t1": 14.86, "shot": "r3", "visual": {"type": "record", "layout": "timeline", "context": "Loan and extension", "heading": "The bridge financing", "source": "extend", "rows": [{"icon": "lease", "label": "City loan closed", "event": "2023-06-06"}, {"icon": "calendar", "label": "Bridge extension approved", "event": "2025-05-02"}, {"icon": "file", "label": "Trust deed modification recorded", "event": "2026-10-09"}]}, "wt": [0.0, 0.12, 0.42, 0.73, 0.83, 1.11, 1.45, 1.65, 2.19, 2.29, 2.75]}, {"scene": "open", "kind": "doc", "ref": ["suspicious[0]", "established[1]"], "text": "The extension scheduled conversion for June 2027. No repayments were due during the bridge.", "t0": 14.98, "t1": 19.87, "shot": "r4", "visual": {"type": "doc", "source": "extend", "kicker": "San Francisco Mayor’s Office of Housing and Community Development", "text": "June 6, 2027", "mark": "June 6, 2027"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.11, 0.62, 1.02, 1.5, 1.66, 1.92, 2.19, 3.21, 3.39, 3.82, 3.96, 4.11, 4.33, 4.43]}, {"scene": "schedule", "kind": "scene", "ref": ["suspicious[1]", "established[1]"], "text": "In May 2025, City staff expected construction that November.", "t0": 20.09, "t1": 23.7, "shot": "r5", "visual": {"type": "scene", "art": "housing", "label": "Construction schedule", "sub": "May 2025 extension"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.16, 0.4, 0.65, 1.48, 1.77, 2.04, 2.43, 2.95, 3.09]}, {"scene": "schedule", "kind": "doc", "ref": ["suspicious[1]", "established[4]"], "text": "By November 2026, the City expected work to begin in early 2027.", "t0": 23.82, "t1": 28.41, "shot": "r6", "visual": {"type": "doc", "source": "update", "kicker": "City and County of San Francisco", "text": "Early 2027", "mark": "Early 2027"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.18, 0.63, 0.9, 1.46, 1.57, 1.89, 2.33, 2.56, 2.66, 3.12, 3.33, 3.67, 3.96]}, {"scene": "schedule", "kind": "quote", "ref": ["established[2]"], "text": "Higher interest rates and expenses reduced the project’s expected borrowing capacity.", "t0": 28.53, "t1": 32.54, "shot": "r7", "visual": {"type": "quote", "line": "Reduced borrowing capacity"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.29, 0.59, 0.86, 0.99, 1.62, 1.98, 2.08, 2.59, 3.04, 3.38]}, {"scene": "schedule", "kind": "scene", "ref": ["established[2]"], "text": "The expected permanent hard loan fell from about 12 million dollars to 9 million.", "t0": 32.66, "t1": 36.26, "shot": "r8", "visual": {"type": "scene", "art": "housing", "label": "Permanent financing", "sub": "Loan extension"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.11, 0.57, 0.96, 1.17, 1.45, 1.64, 1.81, 2.01, 2.28, 2.53, 2.89, 3.02, 3.22]}, {"scene": "funding", "kind": "doc", "ref": ["suspicious[2]", "established[3]"], "text": "The State listed a Homekey award of 18,684,520 dollars.", "t0": 36.48, "t1": 40.08, "shot": "r9", "visual": {"type": "doc", "source": "awards", "kicker": "California Department of Housing and Community Development", "text": "Homekey+ award", "mark": "Homekey+ award"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.12, 0.41, 0.72, 0.79, 1.19, 1.51, 1.6, 1.86, 2.27, 2.53, 2.78, 3.07]}, {"scene": "funding", "kind": "scene", "ref": ["established[3]"], "text": "The State described 44 supported homes in a building with 63 units.", "t0": 40.2, "t1": 43.75, "shot": "r10", "visual": {"type": "scene", "art": "housing", "label": "State award", "sub": "44 supported homes"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.1, 0.34, 0.74, 1.22, 1.62, 1.91, 2.0, 2.07, 2.39, 2.54, 3.08]}, {"scene": "funding", "kind": "record", "ref": ["established[3]"], "text": "The City described 13.2 million dollars for rehabilitation and 5.4 million for operations.", "t0": 43.87, "t1": 49.07, "shot": "r11", "visual": {"type": "record", "layout": "amounts", "context": "Homekey+ award", "heading": "Funding described by the City", "source": "update", "rows": [{"icon": "lease", "label": "Rehabilitation", "value": "$13.2 million"}, {"icon": "transfer", "label": "Operations", "value": "$5.4 million"}]}, "wt": [0.0, 0.13, 0.43, 0.86, 1.31, 1.54, 1.73, 2.01, 2.32, 2.47, 3.24, 3.37, 3.61, 3.82, 3.98, 4.25, 4.4]}, {"scene": "close", "kind": "unknowns", "ref": ["notEstablished[1]", "next[1]"], "text": "A draw ledger would show which costs the State reimburses.", "t0": 49.29, "t1": 52.15, "shot": "r12", "visual": {"type": "unknowns", "cards": ["Loan draws", "State reimbursements"]}, "wt": [0.0, 0.11, 0.33, 0.57, 0.74, 1.03, 1.26, 1.57, 1.68, 2.04]}, {"scene": "close", "kind": "quote", "ref": ["notEstablished[0]"], "text": "The records leave the actual carrying costs and completion date open.", "t0": 52.27, "t1": 55.48, "shot": "r13", "visual": {"type": "quote", "line": "Actual carrying costs remain unknown"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.12, 0.45, 0.65, 0.79, 1.15, 1.51, 1.89, 2.02, 2.52, 2.78]}, {"scene": "close", "kind": "end", "ref": ["status"], "text": "A lead is a question, not an accusation.", "t0": 55.6, "t1": 57.56, "shot": "r14", "visual": {"type": "end"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.12, 0.35, 0.45, 0.52, 1.06, 1.26, 1.35]}], "format": 6, "chapters": {"open": "The bridge loan", "schedule": "Construction schedule", "funding": "State and City funding", "close": "What the ledger would show"}, "look": "dossier", "hook": "timeline"}